      "text": "She follows a link\nin the email to the\nLF webpage that\nexplains the tech,\nand the value to\nLF project\ncommunities. She\ngets the WHY,\nbut is  still unclear\nabout the HOW.",
      "fontSize": 10.072204968944074,
