      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787138533437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Runa gets a\ngeneral, FYI,\nemail from Linus\nannouncing that\nthe Kubernetes\nproject will follow\nthe Kernel project\nin adopting a\nreplacement for\nthe existing Web\nof Trust\nauthentication\nmodel. Rationale\nfor the change.\n\"we tested it with\nthe Kernel team,\nthese are the\nfindings...\", the\nrisks that are\nbeing addressed,\nthe breach that\nlead to it.",
      "fontSize": 9.749999999999991,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Runa gets a general, FYI, email from Linus announcing that the Kubernetes project will follow the Kernel project in adopting a replacement for the existing Web of Trust authentication model. Rationale for the change. \"we tested it with the Kernel team, these are the findings...\", the risks that are being addressed, the breach that lead to it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
