      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There's a\nfollowup email to\nRuna specifically,\nexplaining\ntimeline goals,\nand sharing\nbackground\nresources she'll\nneed. There's a\nCTA asking for\nher to validate or\nadjust timeline so\nthat it is in line\nwith the current\nworkload and\ncapacity of the\ncommunity.  ",
      "fontSize": 10.280633449031784,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There's a followup email to Runa specifically, explaining timeline goals, and sharing background resources she'll need. There's a CTA asking for her to validate or adjust timeline so that it is in line with the current workload and capacity of the community.  ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "pffDJWaEKdlM3J7280Ins",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2118.3714226742445,
      "y": 952.4325787719978,
      "width": 77.65034993489527,
      "height": 235.46249999999978,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "ngSAM_W8pQrdYBLfXHxNw",
      "index": "b05zzzzzzzz9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1926504460,
      "version": 2580,
      "versionNonce": 1955565346,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787138533437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Runa will use the\nLinux hosting\nenvironment to\ncreate the\nKubernetes\ncommunity. \n\nShe initiates the\nprocess by\nclicking a link in\nthe info page,\nand creates the\ncommunity\nidentifier and\nagent.The steps\nin process are\nvisualized so that\nshe knows where\nshe is in the\nprocess and what\nto do next.",
      "fontSize": 9.749999999999991,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Runa will use the Linux hosting environment to create the Kubernetes community. \n\nShe initiates the process by clicking a link in the info page, and creates the community identifier and agent.The steps in process are visualized so that she knows where she is in the process and what to do next.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "9xFd1LOptJFiANklhyWox",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2216.5689673171014,
      "y": 956.7294537719973,
      "width": 77.65034993489527,
      "height": 257.88749999999976,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "ngSAM_W8pQrdYBLfXHxNw",
      "index": "b05zzzzzzzzA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 859849100,
      "version": 2793,
      "versionNonce": 156101630,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787138533437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Upon further\ninvestigation she\nsees that the\noverview site\nprovides a \"how\nto\" for people in\nher role. She\ndives in to\nunderstand the\ndetails. \n\nRuna uses the\nteam messaging\nboard to\nsummarize the\nbaseline\ngovernance\nframework, for\ncomment by the\nteam.\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 9.749999999999991,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Upon further investigation she sees that the overview site provides a \"how to\" for people in her role. She dives in to understand the details. \n\nRuna uses the team messaging board to summarize the baseline governance framework, for comment by the team.\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "Cl-1jU3YR_XCaw6hQjfIW",
